      <chord name="D"/>Tell <chord name="F#m"/>out, <chord name="A"/>my <chord name="D"/>soul, <chord name="Bm"/>the <chord name="A"/>greatness <chord name="D"/>of <chord name="Em"/>the <chord name="F#m"/>Lord:<br/>
