      <chord name="D"/>The hungry <chord name="Bm"/>fed, <chord name="A"/>the <chord name="F#m"/>humble <chord name="A"/>lifted <chord name="D"/>high.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v4">
      <lines>
      <chord name="D"/>Tell <chord name="F#m"/>out, <chord name="A"/>my <chord name="D"/>soul, <chord name="Bm"/>the <chord name="A"/>glories <chord name="D"/>of <chord name="Em"/>His <chord name="F#m"/>word:<br/>
      <chord name="G"/>Firm <chord name="F#m"/>is <chord name="Em"/>His <chord name="A"/>promise, <chord name="G"/>and <chord name="F#m"/>His <chord name="Em"/>mercy sure.<br/>
